/**If you set something with this class, like obj.xxx = Delete , it calls delete obj.xxx and send an Delete event 
 * Addresses the lack of events on delete
 * ```
 * //Bad -> Observe Logic gets no event and key still there in '__meta' object
 * delete colors.A
 * //Ok enough, value in '__meta' obj undefined -> may be garbage collected if obj, but undefiend still there in '__meta' obj
 * colors.A = undefined; delete colors.A
 * //Best, sends Delete event and deletes the underlying '__meta' key
 * colors.A = Delete 
 * ``` 
*/
